                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Seed production of European beech (Fagus sylvatica) is assessed yearly by the Netherlands Institute of Ecology (NIOO-KNAW) since 1976. The data contains individual-level information on beechnut production of a selected set of trees in the Hoge Veluwe National Park, Netherlands, consisting of counts and weights of beechnuts and DBH of the trees."
                }
