          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "This dataset is structured as a Darwin Core Archive consisting of an event core, and two extensions: occurrence and measurement or fact. Descriptive and administrative metadata are stored in EML and structural metadata in the meta.xml file. The dataset additionally consists of a supplementary data file (\"Include_dates\") that indicates which sampling date per year should be included in analyses. Only in a few years several dates were sampled and this ensures selecting only one representative date for these years and thereby consistency with years where only one sample was taken. The R script provides a short pipeline to convert the Darwin Core Archive structure into a structure more easily usable for data analyses."
          },
